menu "AI Passport application"

config PASSPORT_GROK_MCP
    bool "Use the Grok Bot MCP device application"
    default n
    select MBEDTLS_CERTIFICATE_BUNDLE
    select ESP_HTTP_CLIENT_ENABLE_HTTPS
    help
        Start the independent MCP device UI instead of the hardware demo.
        Configure main/grok_local_config.h using the example header.
        The device polls your HTTPS gateway; Grok Bot calls its MCP tools.
        This does not implement Grok Bot voice chat or a private Bot API.

endmenu
